      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786351074903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yap\u0131lan i\u015Fleri g\u00FCn sonu t\u00FCm\u00FC yap\u0131ld\u0131. olarak i\u015Faretleme, veya tek tek yap\u0131ld\u0131 olarak i\u015Faretle tutar k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 elle d\u00FCzenleme isterse gider girebilme \nbununda ayarlar\u0131 olacak ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yap\u0131lan i\u015Fleri g\u00FCn sonu t\u00FCm\u00FC yap\u0131ld\u0131. olarak i\u015Faretleme, veya tek tek yap\u0131ld\u0131 olarak i\u015Faretle tutar k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 elle d\u00FCzenleme isterse gider girebilme \nbununda ayarlar\u0131 olacak ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
